		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4129&amp;p=31574#p31574"><![CDATA[
Hello,<br><br>if you want to use CPS on Mac OS. It is possible to run it on Windows in VirtualBox. Before you start virtual machine you need to remove Mac’s ACM kernel module. <br><br>The command is here. After unload start Windows and CPS works:-). <br><br>sudo kextunload -b com.apple.driver.usb.cdc.acm<br><br><br>Best regards,<br>OK7ZKL<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=6281">OK7ZKL</a> — Thu Jun 06, 2024 3:58 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
